+# Combine practice menu attribution
+
+The native practice menu is a source-derived port of **Synergy MW2**, by
+SyndiShanX, pinned to `33bcc80f5446e7543a2eb68b17c798e29d3f27c4`:
+https://github.com/SyndiShanX/Synergy-GSC-Menu/tree/33bcc80f5446e7543a2eb68b17c798e29d3f27c4/MW2
+
+Synergy credits M203 by Xeirh and the Apparition Structure Team: CF4_99
+(main developer), Extinct, ItsFebiven and Joel (ideas and suggestions).
+Its GPL version 3 licence is preserved verbatim in LICENSES/Synergy-GPL-3.0.md.
+
+Combine modifications, 2026-10-03:
+
+- Ported initial_variables, create_menu, input_manager, open_menu, close_menu,
+  set_menu_visibility, new_menu, scroll_cursor and set_options into native Rust
+  state/navigation and Bevy UI. Seven slots, scrolling, cursor/history retention,
+  right-side panel, title, selection bar, submenu arrows and footer are derived
+  from those functions. Cyan replaces the rainbow theme.
+- Replaced GSC execution with a closed action enum connected to existing local
+  practice actions. Added keyboard/D-pad support and input release barriers.
+- Removed the initial controls banner. Closing destroys every menu UI entity.
+  Used the runtime's existing Oxanium game UI font; imported no Synergy assets.
+- Added synthetic tests and a standalone asset-free native rendering preview.
+
+The adapted menu and console crate containing it are GPL-3.0-only. Existing
+upstream files keep their copyright notices; the upstream Apache-2.0 LICENSE
+and NOTICE remain intact. Distribution of a combined executable needs the
+corresponding source and applicable notices/licences; no executable or game
+assets are distributed by this patch. This notice does not grant game-asset
+rights, publisher permission, or permission to redistribute local caches.
+
+No IW4x binary, GSC loader, or unrelated Synergy gameplay modification is included.
